    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zoomageddon: The Birth of Year of the Cat</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.poster.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.webm?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.mp4?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Adventure in Zoomageddon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an orange cat in a post-apocalyptic world where you collect Mighty Beasts abilities and challenge the Rat King. Inspired by Vampire Survivors, a game that started the Bullet-heaven genre, Zoomageddon is a unique blend of bullet-heaven and base-building mechanics set in a world teeming with mutant animals. As Oyen the cat, uncover the mysteries of Zoomageddon, unlock various buildings, and discover new quirky powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the Zoomageddon, Neo-Pankou has risen from the ashes. Oyen, the Orange Cat, serves in its military to protect against threats beyond the city walls. His mission: to destroy the Rat King\u2019s nest. But as he ventures out, the Trail of Mysteries reveals truths that challenge everything he knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twelve Chinese zodiacs are subtly woven into the story. Each boss Oyen faces represents one of these zodiac animals, adding an intriguing layer of mystery and challenge to his mission!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/1bbfba19f82954e0a32fe2d3dd830ebf.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Heaven Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, action-packed gameplay reminiscent of Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.poster.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.webm?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.mp4?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bd7ebff9a92b573e31df5187b78df4b2.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Procedurally-Generated Dungeon Crawling</strong>: Create and customize your base while delving into endless dungeons with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/e109eb04185fc8178ba98c5023a582c1.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mighty Beasts Abilities</strong>: Collect and utilize unique powers from various beasts you encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/c82c01b3b1fff11c3572475d19b8cf1a.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Storyline with Eastern Zodiac Lore</strong>: Discover the story behind each zodiac sign, including the epic tale of how the Rat earned its spot by betraying the Cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/fca16e61207d8588f567c54a94031c8c.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=320 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zoomageddon: The Birth of Year of the Cat</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.poster.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.webm?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bb52718bf3a31928897bed1d785353a8.mp4?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Adventure in Zoomageddon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an orange cat in a post-apocalyptic world where you collect Mighty Beasts abilities and challenge the Rat King. Inspired by Vampire Survivors, a game that started the Bullet-heaven genre, Zoomageddon is a unique blend of bullet-heaven and base-building mechanics set in a world teeming with mutant animals. As Oyen the cat, uncover the mysteries of Zoomageddon, unlock various buildings, and discover new quirky powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the Zoomageddon, Neo-Pankou has risen from the ashes. Oyen, the Orange Cat, serves in its military to protect against threats beyond the city walls. His mission: to destroy the Rat King\u2019s nest. But as he ventures out, the Trail of Mysteries reveals truths that challenge everything he knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twelve Chinese zodiacs are subtly woven into the story. Each boss Oyen faces represents one of these zodiac animals, adding an intriguing layer of mystery and challenge to his mission!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/1bbfba19f82954e0a32fe2d3dd830ebf.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Heaven Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, action-packed gameplay reminiscent of Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.poster.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.webm?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/87bbc7caa7140d6e7f82f04c834044f6.mp4?t=1742309201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/bd7ebff9a92b573e31df5187b78df4b2.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Procedurally-Generated Dungeon Crawling</strong>: Create and customize your base while delving into endless dungeons with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/e109eb04185fc8178ba98c5023a582c1.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mighty Beasts Abilities</strong>: Collect and utilize unique powers from various beasts you encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/c82c01b3b1fff11c3572475d19b8cf1a.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Storyline with Eastern Zodiac Lore</strong>: Discover the story behind each zodiac sign, including the epic tale of how the Rat earned its spot by betraying the Cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/fca16e61207d8588f567c54a94031c8c.avif?t=1742309201\" width=616 height=320 /></span></p></li></ul>",
